  m_text: "\u2026that\u2019s the thing, history isn\u2019t something that\u2019s
    finished, gone. It\u2019s forever. We\u2019re part of it right now, we take our
    little turn. There are things even in this room that were around long before
    we were born and will still be here after we\u2019re dead."
